    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWe are delighted to offer for sale No. 2 An Caireal, a brand-new, newly completed four-bedroom detached home in one of Tralee's most sought-after locations\n\nSituated on a spacious 0.2 acre site (approx) this is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to acquire a stunning new home that is ready to go, with no delay and no waiting for a new build to be completed. \n\nReady for its final finishes, this exceptional property offers the successful purchaser the unique opportunity to complete the home to their own taste and specification.\n\nIdeally positioned immediately adjacent to Mercy Mounthawk Secondary School, the property enjoys an outstanding location, perfectly suited to modern family living.\n\nBoasting an A-rated energy efficiency, an air-to-water heating system, concrete block construction, a Ducon slab to the first floor, and high-quality windows and doors throughout, No. 2 An Caireal has been constructed to an excellent standard and offers a superb foundation for a luxurious family home.\n\nWith its impressive scale, contemporary design, exceptional construction and enviable location, this house will undoubtedly impress those seeking a substantial family home with the freedom to finish and personalise it to their own exact specification."
      },
      {
