        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room - 6.2 x 4.5\n\n\nEntrance Hall - 5.9 x 3.3\n\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 4.5 x 6.9\n\n\nUtility Room - 3.9 x 2.3\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.5 x 3.8\n\n\nWC - 2.1 x 2.5\n\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 5.9 x 1.4\n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.9 x 5.1\n\n\nEnsuite - 2.5 x 2.3\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.1 x 4.5\n\n\nEnsuite - 2 x 3.1\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.8 x 4.5\n\n\nEnsuite - 2 x 2.65\n\n\nHot Press - 1.4 x 2.65\n\n\n"
